#undef NDEBUG
// Review HG: routes past /api/mine's defaults keyed by a typed attribute or
// column on an upload's log shape (XES: read_xes' legacy log objects; CSV:
// convert_to_event_log's cells).
//
// - The log skeleton (discovery and conformance), the temporal profile and
//   its conformance, and the transition system on a session read the same
//   objects as /api/mine's families; a NaN or NaT meets its own equivalence
//   in the skeleton's conformance (unequal to itself).
// - /api/evaluate on the Alpha and Heuristics++ nets keyed by such a key
//   replays the log as the net meets it, and the ETConformance precision
//   (and /api/mine's token-replay precision) raises pm4py's TypeError when a
//   prefix joins an object that is no str.
// - An explicitly supplied token-replay key replays its own objects or
//   cells against each net (Python ==), after the transitions' sort; the
//   Alpha miner's KeyError stands when a trace of two or more events lacks
//   its key.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hg: tc/mkhg.py, ct/routes.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hg_tests <minera_server>
